 geode:{name:'Geode',type:'rock',cost:1,tgt:'self',art:'💎',text:V=>'Gain '+V(8,'blk')+' Block. Until your next turn, if an enemy hit breaks your Block, draw 2 extra cards at the start of your next turn. Triggers once.',run:c=>{c.block(8);c.dc.geode=1}},
